  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Wasted since the war started, a denizen of Last Sip found passed out in Stealth alley by the Featherguard. Rumored to be able to sniff out where the last drops of DRIP are, though no one knows if its true or just his hangover.",
    "class": "DRIP Diviner",
    "name": "Buzzed Bill",
    "personality": "Cynical and world-weary, Buzzed Bill is rarely seen without a grimace and a sarcastic remark. Though often drunk, he possess a keen sense of observation and can often pick up on clues that others miss, especially regarding DRIP stores. Most suspect he is a coward but, when cornered, his sense of self-preservation leads to surprising acts of daring and tenacity.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Once per encounter, Buzzed Bill can attempt to 'Sniff Out the DRIP', granting the party advantage on their next DRIP-related loot roll. Chance of success determined by a DC12 Intelligence check.",
      "name": "Sniff Out the DRIP"
    },
